    "note": "Informational projection of the contract and receipt; only the statement and manifest are cryptographically bound.",
    "objective": "When attestation.signing.provider is sigstore, the automatic evidence export on complete signs the attestation statement with the configured Sigstore provider (cosign attest-blob) before exporting, so the bundle carries the signature. Signing failures are reported in the evidence result and the bundle is still exported unsigned; an existing signature is never replaced. The hosted App check is unchanged and stays INTEGRITY_ONLY.",
